{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A computer can do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/b/50b19142d92b7b4f1a115c4ec91766582e2b8faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" /> additions per second.  How many additions can it do in one hour?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3b6aaac63406c99e68a4d6fe51f58a7a57347b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 6\\text{ million} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 36\\text{ million} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 60\\text{ million} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 216\\text{ million} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 360\\text{ million}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"661\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using dimensional analysis, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/b/89b87d693336ed788f728835aff3a782602d2a2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\frac{10000\\text{ additions}}{1\\text{ second}} \\cdot \\frac{3600\\text{ seconds}}{1\\text{ hour}} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 36 \\text{ million}}\\text{ additions/hour}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"494\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME\" title=\"1987 AJHSME\">1987 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJ